r and lavender gradient hues, ethereal halo around form – Tile effect  \n6. Powerful green-dragon hybrid, nature guardian design, muscular coiled tail and clawed feet focus, high quality, high resolution, mist-shrouded ancient forest setting, emerald foliage blending into scale pattern, dappled sunlight beams through canopy – Tile effect  \n7. Elegant unicorn mare, magical realism approach, flowing mane capturing wind movement, high quality, high resolution, crystal-clear lake reflecting its image in calm waters, rainbow prismatic colors from horn sparkles, dreamlike atmosphere surrounding it – Tile effect  \n8. Mythical phoenix reborn, cycle of renewal symbolism, flaming plumage transitioning to new feathers, high quality, high resolution, volcanic ash mountains rising behind, golden and crimson flames against twilight sky, dynamic spiral energy trails forming updrafts – Tile effect  \n9. Protective dragon hatchling, family bond narrative, tiny claws gripping parent’s neck tenderly, high quality, high resolution, snowy alpine valley environment below massive adult dragons soaring above, warm amber light glows between them, soft fur textures highlighted by backlighting effects – Tile effect"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 184, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "9f7b3215e6af317603056a9a1666bf6e83e28835", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [184], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 252], "pos": [-2995.3818359375, 5573.6044921875], "widgets_values": ["MiniCPM-V-4.5-int4", "Describe", "仅参照输入图片中的主体(动物/人物)的特征,一共生成9套可以直接在Midjourney上使用的,用于生成亚马逊畅销毛毯画面的提示词.\n要求:\n1.提示词示例是：\"Pink and white high heels, pink flower design, vector illustration style, cartoon style, high quality, high resolution, pink flowers and butterflies dancing around the shoes, pink color scheme, pink butterfly decoration on the top of the shoes - Tile effect \".\n2. 给出的提示词应能直接复制去Midjourney使用，每套需包含但不限于【主体】+【风格】+【差异化关键词】+【技术参数】.\n3. 保留所有提到的设计元素内容，提取该设计的核心设计元素（如主题内容、色彩搭配、整体风格等），但需改变风格或融合新元素,改变的方向为参考亚马逊其它畅销的毛毯设计风格、色彩搭配、画风、构图或元素。 \n5. 严格按照提示词示例的格式生成，只输出提示词部分,不要有任何解释类描述.", "Auto", "Keep in Memory", 1117621350110950, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 183, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "shape": 7, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "shape": 7, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "shape": 7, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "memory_management"}, "shape": 7, "name": "memory_management", "label": "memory_management", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "memory_management"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 91, "type": "AILab_MiniCPM_4_V", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_MiniCPM_4_V"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "batch", "slot_index": 0, "links": [24], "label": "batch", "type": "*", "localized_name": "batch"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [190.66395568847656, 5028.09326171875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "any_1", "link": 37, "label": "any_1", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any_1"}, {"name": "any_2", "link": 38, "label": "any_2", "type": "*", "loc